{"unit_id":"ylwl1997__noatmark-dsh-plugin#feature-1","repo":"ylwl1997/noatmark-dsh-plugin","commit":"0e28246d0208e11b7d6ca0883af4722d5ef58bb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"NoAtMark Text Hygiene 的功能「sanitize_text」：清理输入文本中的零宽字符等不可见字符，并标记提示注入模式与隐藏 HTML 文本信号；注入风险只会被标记，不会自动删除。输入一段文本，返回结构化清理结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21-35"]}
{"unit_id":"ylwl1997__noatmark-dsh-plugin#feature-2","repo":"ylwl1997/noatmark-dsh-plugin","commit":"0e28246d0208e11b7d6ca0883af4722d5ef58bb4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"NoAtMark Text Hygiene 的功能「scan_text」：检查文本中的不可见字符、提示注入模式和隐藏文本信号，报告字符类别、数量、码点与位置，不修改原文。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:38-61"]}
